  id: upg.worldevents
  category: 5
  title: World Events
  subtitle: Weekly Global Modifiers
  body: "Unlocks weekly World Events.\r\n\r\nEvery Monday, a new global event is
    selected. \r\nEvents can modify Job Sites, Encounters, or shop prices \u2014
    or simply display world news.\r\n\r\nOnly one event is active at a time.\r\nThe
    first week after unlocking is neutral."
